    "categories": ["housing-utilities"],
    // A storage service for people who are homeless -- closest to housing-utilities among the six.
    "summary": "A free storage facility in Madison where people experiencing homelessness can keep personal papers, mementos, out-of-season clothing, and work tools. Up to 45 people can use it at a time.",
    "benefit": "Up to two storage bins and a secure file for documents, at no cost. Storage can be extended.",
